    },
    "1か月あたり%@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ per month"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "3か月より前の家事の記録も、いつでも振り返れます。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Look back on chores from more than 3 months ago, anytime."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OK" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "OK"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ありがとうございます" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Thank you!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "お支払いはApple Accountに請求されます。期間が終わる24時間前までに解約しない限り、サブスクリプションは自動で更新されます。解約は、App Storeのアカウント設定からいつでも行えます。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Payment will be charged to your Apple Account. Your subscription renews automatically unless canceled at least 24 hours before the end of the current period. You can cancel anytime in your App Store account settings."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "すべての記録を振り返れます" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Look back on your entire history"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "やり方や仕上がりを写真で残して、同居人と共有できます。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Save how a chore is done or how it turned out, and share it with your housemates."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "バナー広告が消え、家事の記録に集中できます。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Banner ads disappear so you can focus on your chores."
